      "answer": "$a=2$, $b=-1$, $f(-2)=10$",
      "solution": "$f(x) = (x^2-2x+4)Q_1(x)+3x-8$\n$f(x) = (x^3+8)Q_2(x)+ax^2+bx$\n$= (x+2)(x^2-2x+4)Q_2(x)+ax^2+bx$\n$= (x^2-2x+4)\\{(x+2)Q_2(x)+a\\}+3x-8$\n이므로 $a(x^2-2x+4)+3x-8 = ax^2+bx$이다.\n그러므로, $a = 2$, $b = -1$, $f(-2) = 10$",
